OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBecoming
OL,6,Fdrier during the evening, with
OL,7,Fremaining blustery showers becoming
OL,8,Fincreasingly isolated and mainly
OL,9,Faffecting the west. Becoming chilly
OL,10,Funder more lasting clear spells, with
OL,11,Fthese more likely in the east.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FMainly fine initially, with
OL,14,Fsunny spells and the odd shower.
OL,15,FShowers fading but cloud thickening
OL,16,Finto the afternoon, culminating in a
OL,17,Fwetter and windier end to the day.
OL,18,FNear-average temperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
