OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FBright
OL,6,Fand breezy Saturday, perhaps the odd
OL,7,Fshower. Sunday starting fine, but
OL,8,Fcloudier later. Cloudier Monday with a
OL,9,Flittle rain, brightest in the east.
OL,10,FTemperatures near normal, becoming
OL,11,Fwarmer Monday.
